<title>RUSSIA: Foreigners welcome in Svyazinvest tender - Chubais.</title>
<headline>Foreigners welcome in Svyazinvest tender - Chubais.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investors will be welcome to participate in the auction for shares in state telecommunications holding company Svyazinvest, Russian First Deputy Prime Minister Anatoly Chubais said on Friday.</p>
<p>Chubais said the auction for a 25 percent stake in Svyazinvest, Russia's biggest privatisation to date, was due at the start of July. &quot;This is an open auction. We deeply welcome any kind of foreign participation,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
